    "group": "Cadian Recon Squad",
    "summary": "As the battle starts, you may place the Cadian Recon Squad’s Vox‑relay Beacon anywhere on the field outside the opponent’s deployment zone. A friendly unit with ASTRA MILITARUM and REGIMENT within 6″ of the beacon can receive Orders from an OFFICER unit in your army as though that unit were within 6″ of the recipient. Remove the marker if an enemy unit sets up or ends a move within 1″ of it.",
